    "title": "Control aspect ratio with --ar",
    "body": [
      {
        "text": "Add parameters to the end of your prompt, starting with --, like "
      },
      {
        "text": "--ar 16:9",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " (landscape), "
      },
      {
        "text": "--ar 9:16",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " (vertical, for mobile), "
      },
      {
        "text": "--ar 1:1",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " (square). Pick the one that matches where you'll use the image."
      }
    ],
    "example": "a serene beach at sunset, palm trees, warm tones --ar 16:9",
    "mascot": "mascot-read"
  },
  {
    "type": "theory",
    "tag": "Midjourney · Chapter 4 · Part 2",
    "title": "Model version and stylization",
    "body": [
      {
        "text": "--v",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " selects the model version (newer versions are usually more realistic), while "
      },
      {
        "text": "--stylize",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " (or --s) controls how much artistic flair the AI adds. Low = sticks to the prompt; high = prettier but can drift from the prompt."
      }
    ],
    "example": "minimalist logo, geometric, clean --v 6 --s 100",
    "mascot": "mascot-read"
  },
